#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""twain — a unified diff is two patches.

git apply / sate occupy a mixed patch as one before→after claim.
alibi runs tests. Neither asks the reviewer question about the *patch*:

  did the oracle-half land without the production-half,
  the production-half without oracles,
  or oracles that never mention the production change?

twain splits a unified diff into oracle vs production, occupies each half
against a tree, and reports whether the oracle-half binds the production-half.
"""
